doctype html
html(lang="en")
  head
    meta(charset="UTF-8")
    meta(name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0")
    title Alliance contract suspended

  body
      p Hi #{name},

      p The Alliance relies on the dependability of all members. Since you missed an assigned non-optional task in each of the last 3 weeks you had tasks, we've suspended your agreement automatically.

      p If this was in error or if you have any questions, please contact us.
